The {{Term/Store|Gerudo Sirwal||Series, BotW, AoC}} is a recurring [[Item]] in {{TLoZ Series}}.{{Exp Game|BotW, AoC}}<ref name="BotW Inventory"/><ref name="AoC Allies"/>

==Location and Uses==
==={{BotW|-}}===
{{Descriptions BotW}}
The Gerudo Sirwal can be acquired from [[Vilia]] on top of the Kara Kara Bazaar, who sells the sirwal along with the rest of the set for 600 Rupees as part of the "[[Forbidden City Entry]]" [[Main Quest]]. It can also be purchased by itself from [[Saula]] in Gerudo Town for 180 Rupees. It provides [[Link]] with 3 defense, and if the entire [[Gerudo Outfit]] is worn, Link will have level 1 Heat Resistance, even though the pieces of the set cannot be upgraded at a [[Great Fairy Fountain]].

